{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"盼着对方也能接受自己这回不再藏着的喜欢\",\"source\":\"盼着对方也喜欢他不再小心收着的样子。\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文希望对方也喜欢自己不再收敛的样子，屏幕稿改成希望对方接受自己表达出来的喜欢，改变了期待的具体内容。\"},{\"sec\":\"S07\",\"screen\":\"他独自回想和对方相处的时光，那点亲近又浮上心头\",\"source\":\"像独处时反复回想一段关系，记忆慢慢变成气味、身体感觉、幻想、遗憾和快感，混在一起。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把独自回想一段关系作为听感想象，屏幕稿却把它具体化为这个人独自回想与对方相处的经历。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"紧绷的肩膀终于松开，胸腔打开\",\"source\":\"像一直微微绷着肩膀的人，终于长长呼出一口气，胸腔一下打开。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿用身体动作作比喻描写情绪舒展，屏幕稿去掉比喻标记，将其写成了这个人实际发生的身体动作。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9a4fbdb1-d7b8-421f-91bb-8202c7c6aac4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T211718751243Z", "elapsed_seconds": 273.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T21:21:52.054116+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dcc90a4e3d8c9a481029a37a2d844712da7e8d6873f8ce8d09b9f4ffe6e53bad", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23e